      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "text": "The extracted feature must support this observable behavior: freeze_time context manager and decorator. Required observable cases include freeze context manager; freeze decorator; unfrozen after context."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B002",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "text": "The extracted feature must support this observable behavior: tick and move_to advance frozen time. Required observable cases include tick moves time; move to."
    },
